## SQ-CUP-01 | Miner's Delight without the copper cup family: data loads, no cup id anywhere
@group A
@commands boot; `grep -nE "Cup conversions\|cup_conversion\|miners_delight:[a-z_]*cup\|cactus_soup_cup\|Error occurred while handling event" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log`
@pass `Done (`; `Miner's Delight upstream data:` line present (count lower than 182: cup recipes, Create fill/empty recipes, cup advancement and cup conversion gone); no `Cup conversions` line; no line naming a cup id; no `Unknown item` from `item_dict.js`, `food_dict.js`, `tool_dict.js`, `stack_sizes.js` or comfort_nourishment
@fails a cup id still in `MinersTranslator.REMOVED`'s miss list, or a script key (`i.copper_cup` etc.) left in a dict or recipe script
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
bootexpect Miner's Delight upstream data: \d+ files
bootreject Cup conversions
bootreject (?i)\bminers_delight:(copper|water|milk|powder_snow|beef_stew|onion_soup|[a-z_]+)_cup\b
bootreject (?i)\bdelightful:cactus_soup_cup\b
kjsreject (?i)\bminers_delight:[a-z_]*_cup\b|cactus_soup_cup
shell n=$(grep -oE "Miner's Delight upstream data: [0-9]+" logs/latest.log | grep -oE "[0-9]+$" | head -1); echo "upstream files $n (182 before)"; grep -nE "Unknown item" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -iE "item_dict|food_dict|tool_dict|stack_sizes|comfort" | head; echo "handler errors: $(grep -c 'Error occurred while handling event' logs/latest.log)"; [ -n "$n" ] && [ "$n" -lt 182 ]
look rows/SQ-CUP-01.shell.txt: no Unknown item line from the dicts, stack_sizes or comfort_nourishment; any handler error line is unrelated to cups

## SQ-CUP-02 | no cup items: 50 miners_delight items, every cup /give unknown, cactus soup kept
@group A
@commands probe: count registry items in namespace `miners_delight`; `/give @p miners_delight:copper_cup`, `water_cup`, `milk_cup`, `powder_snow_cup`, `beef_stew_cup`, `onion_soup_cup`, `delightful:cactus_soup_cup`
@pass 50 `miners_delight` items; every `/give` fails with unknown item; `delightful:cactus_soup` still exists
@fails `MDItems` / `DelightfulBackportRegistry`
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb passed
> zsb ns miners_delight
> give @p miners_delight:copper_cup
> give @p miners_delight:water_cup
> give @p miners_delight:milk_cup
> give @p miners_delight:powder_snow_cup
> give @p miners_delight:beef_stew_cup
> give @p miners_delight:onion_soup_cup
> give @p delightful:cactus_soup_cup
> zq item delightful:cactus_soup
