expect \[zsb\] ns miners_delight: 50 items, cup ids \(0\)
count Unknown item >= 7
expect \[zq\] item delightful:cactus_soup: class (?!AirItem)

## SQ-CUP-03 | Copper Pot: recipe keyed on the water bucket; soups served in bowls (x 110..122)
@group A
@commands recipe probe for `miners_delight:copper_pot`; `/setblock` a lit campfire and a copper pot; `/data merge block` the inputs of Cave Soup, Bat Soup, a Farmer's Delight beef stew and Delightful Cactus Soup in turn; wait; `/data get block`
@pass the Copper Pot recipe exists, its centre key is only `minecraft:water_bucket`; each soup comes out as its bowl item (count as the recipe) with container `minecraft:bowl`
@fails `MinersTranslator.withoutRemovedAlternatives` (the recipe dropped whole if the patch missed), `CopperPotBlockEntity.servedResult`
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
> zq rdetail miners_delight:copper_pot
> zsb potnbt miners_delight:cave_soup
> zsb potnbt miners_delight:bat_soup
> zsb potnbt farmersdelight:beef_stew
> zsb potnbt delightful:cactus_soup
waitlog \[zsb\] potnbt delightful:cactus_soup 30
capture CP1 \[zsb\] potnbt miners_delight:cave_soup (\{.*\})$
capture CT1 \[zsb\] potrecipe \S+ cook (\d+) -> \d+ miners_delight:cave_soup
capture CP2 \[zsb\] potnbt miners_delight:bat_soup (\{.*\})$
capture CT2 \[zsb\] potrecipe \S+ cook (\d+) -> \d+ miners_delight:bat_soup
capture CP3 \[zsb\] potnbt farmersdelight:beef_stew (\{.*\})$
capture CT3 \[zsb\] potrecipe \S+ cook (\d+) -> \d+ farmersdelight:beef_stew
capture CP4 \[zsb\] potnbt delightful:cactus_soup (\{.*\})$
capture CT4 \[zsb\] potrecipe \S+ cook (\d+) -> \d+ delightful:cactus_soup
expect \[zq\] miners_delight:copper_pot \{
> setblock 110 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 110 -59 500 miners_delight:copper_pot
> data merge block 110 -59 500 {CP1}
> setblock 114 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 114 -59 500 miners_delight:copper_pot
> data merge block 114 -59 500 {CP2}
> setblock 118 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 118 -59 500 miners_delight:copper_pot
> data merge block 118 -59 500 {CP3}
> setblock 122 -60 500 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 122 -59 500 miners_delight:copper_pot
> data merge block 122 -59 500 {CP4}
shell m=0; for t in {CT1} {CT2} {CT3} {CT4}; do [ "$t" -gt "$m" ] && m=$t; done; sleep $(( m / 20 + 15 )); echo "waited $(( m / 20 + 15 )) s"
> data get block 110 -59 500
> data get block 114 -59 500
> data get block 118 -59 500
> data get block 122 -59 500
expect 110, -59, 500 has the following block data: .*miners_delight:cave_soup
expect 114, -59, 500 has the following block data: .*miners_delight:bat_soup
expect 118, -59, 500 has the following block data: .*farmersdelight:beef_stew
expect 122, -59, 500 has the following block data: .*delightful:cactus_soup
reject has the following block data: .*_cup"
reject (Unknown (item|block|entity)|Unknown or incomplete command|Incorrect argument for command|That position is not loaded|\[(zq|zsb|zlbs)\] (error|unknown))
look the copper_pot rdetail line: the centre ingredient is only minecraft:water_bucket; each pot: the soup served (output slot) in its bowl with the recipe's count, container minecraft:bowl (potrecipe lines)

## SQ-CUP-04 | milk tags without the cup; a Supplementaries jar takes Cave Soup and gives the bowl back (x 140; /reload first)
@group A
@commands tag probe `#forge:milk`, `#forge:milk/milk`; `/data get` a Supplementaries jar filled with Cave Soup via fake player
@pass neither tag names `miners_delight:milk_cup` (tags load without error); the jar fills from a bowl of Cave Soup and gives the bowl back
@fails translator tag strip; `soft_fluids/cave_soup.json`
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
# /reload fills Moonlight's soft-fluid item map (empty on a dedicated server until a player joins or a reload);
# it truncates logs/kubejs/server.log, so this row is last
> reload
waitlog Loaded \d+ pocket computer upgrades 300
sleep 10
> zq itemtag forge:milk
> zq itemtag forge:milk/milk
waitlog \[zq\] itemtag forge:milk/milk 30
reject \[zq\] itemtag forge:milk(/milk)? \(\d+\): .*miners_delight:milk_cup
reject (?i)(failed to load|couldn't load) tag.*milk
> setblock 140 -60 500 supplementaries:jar
> pbot spawn cup4 140.5 -60 502.5 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold cup4 miners_delight:cave_soup
> pbot use cup4 140 -60 500 up
> data get block 140 -60 500
> data get entity cup4 SelectedItem
> data get entity cup4 Inventory
> pbot remove cup4
expect 140, -60, 500 has the following block data: .*cave_soup
expect cup4 has the following entity data: .*minecraft:bowl
reject (Unknown (item|block|entity)|Unknown or incomplete command|Incorrect argument for command|That position is not loaded|No entity was found|no such bot|no such item)
look the "pbot use" reply is SUCCESS / CONSUME; the jar's fluid is the cave soup; the bot holds a bowl

